| TTM net margin | 192,879 ÷ 302,969 | **63.7%** |

**Critical mechanical caveat:** ROE of ~117% is a *denominator* artifact as much as an earnings achievement. Equity has more than doubled in 12 months ($100.1B → $229.0B) and will keep compounding. **Even if net income is perfectly flat, ROE will mechanically compress toward ~70–80% over the next four quarters.** Do not read declining ROE as deteriorating business quality — and do not use a historical ROE-based valuation anchor, because the equity base is being re-based in real time.

