## 12. Risk Register and Thesis-Invalidation Triggers

| Risk | Evidence in current data | Specific trigger to monitor |
|---|---|---|
| **Gross-margin plateau / cost pressure** | GM flat at 74.93% → 74.97% after a 1,450bp recovery; FY2026 GM (71.1%) below FY2025 (75.0%) despite +65% revenue | Two consecutive quarters **below 73.0% GM** = pricing power eroding |
| **Cash conversion / earnings quality** | OCF/NI fell 94.7% → **63.1%**; Q2 FY2027 conversion only 40.3% | Full-year OCF/NI **below 75%** with rising DSO |
| **Ecosystem investment circularity** | $35.1B investing outflow in H1 FY2027 = 47% of OCF; 41% of earnings not reaching FCF | Investing outflows **>50% of OCF** for two straight periods; any impairment charge |
| **Growth deceleration math** | Sequential growth decelerating 21.9% → 19.5% → 19.8% → 17.9%; YoY base now $96B/quarter | QoQ growth **below 10%** would cut the FY2027 estimate materially |
| **Customer/supply concentration** | Not disclosed in dataset | Hyperscaler capex guidance; CoWoS/HBM allocation; export-control changes |
| **Cyclical inventory reversal (FY2023 analog)** | FY2023: flat revenue, −55% net income, −800bp GM | Any customer-inventory correction commentary |
| **Dilution offsetting buybacks** | Shares down only ~1%/yr despite ~$48B/yr financing outflow | SBC line unavailable — request it |
| **Mechanical ROE compression** | Equity $100.1B → $229.0B in 12 months | Not a quality issue; do not misread |
| **Deleveraging of the "AI trade"** | Valuation data unavailable | Multiple compression risk is the dominant downside vector, not earnings |

