### 7. Actionable scenarios

**Base case (highest probability): continued 209–229 range work.** RSI 51.87, price on the 10 EMA, volume below average, 10 EMA below 20 SMA, and a powerful 217.50 magnet all argue for sideways chop. Trade the edges, not the middle. *The middle is where the 600M-share value area sits — it is the worst place to initiate.*

**Bullish — needs confirmation, not anticipation.**
- **Trigger:** daily close **above 221.4** (clears both Aug 31 and Sep 1 highs), confirmed by **reclaim of 218.78 on expanding volume >150M** *and* the **10 EMA crossing back above the 20 SMA**.
